<div class="notice-box">
                <p>This End User License Agreement ("EULA") covers your use of the CertiFried service we run (the Discord bot, the dashboard at certifriedmultitool.com and the stream bot) and of the official CertiFried Studio builds we publish. CertiFried&rsquo;s source code is licensed separately under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or later (AGPL); this EULA does not limit anything that licence allows you to do with the code. It works alongside our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a> and <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. By inviting the bot, using the dashboard or the stream bot, or installing CertiFried Studio, you accept this EULA.</p>
