                <h2 id="license-grant">2. Use of the Hosted Service</h2>
                <p>Subject to your continued compliance with this EULA, the <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>, and the policies of Discord and the other platforms you connect, CertiFried ("we", "us") grants you a <strong>limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable permission</strong> to:</p>
