                    <li>Access and use the web dashboard at certifriedmultitool.com to configure those servers;</li>
                    <li>Use the stream bot with Twitch and Kick channels you own or are allowed to manage;</li>
                    <li>Install and run the official CertiFried Studio builds on computers you use;</li>
                    <li>Use the bot's commands and features for their intended personal and community purposes.</li>
                </ul>
                <p>This permission is about using our servers and our builds. Your rights in the code itself come from the AGPL, not from this section, and are not limited by it.</p>
