                <p>Where you connect third-party accounts (for example Twitch, Kick, Spotify, StreamElements, Streamlabs, Steam, Buy Me a Coffee or Ko-fi), you grant us permission to access those services on your behalf solely to deliver the feature you enabled, and you remain responsible for complying with each third party's terms.</p>
